{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act26side_level_act26side_04_end",
  "groupId": "act26side",
  "stageId": "act26side_04",
  "title": "My Life I Gave for You",
  "storyCode": "HE-4",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act26side/level_act26side_04_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "0d603cda4bef4b6100433ae59039114bc2b2f45a49f8e4e4fc90c9f29a902cdb",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Fire devours all indiscriminately.\nOne fire can destroy everything, no matter how precious, no matter how treasured."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Gerald once said the Sarkaz have no home, only war that follows them wherever they go. They swore fealty to their lord in the hope of finding a home of their own.\nHe left because he became disappointed.\nI did not dare to ask why he was disappointed.\nWe were full of hope when we first came here.\nWe were happy despite the hardship.\nBut now...\nNow, they are leaving. Is it because life here has disappointed him in the same way?\nWhat about me?\nI am watching the things I treasured burn before my eyes.\nBurning.\nFading away."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Clément",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Clément",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Gone... all gone..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anxious Inhabitant",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Fire! Fire!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Panicked Inhabitant",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The sacrarium is burning! Get water! Water!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raimund",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What's going on? Is that a fire?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Panicked Inhabitant",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Raimund! What are you doing here? I thought you had..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raimund",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Now's not the time for that!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Panicked Inhabitant",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Y-You're right!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Panicked Inhabitant",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The sacrarium's on fire! Give me a hand!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raimund",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The sacrarium?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raimund",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How did the sacrarium catch fire?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Panicked Inhabitant",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How should I know?! Fires have happened before, but nothing as bad as this one. And the timing!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Panicked Inhabitant",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We need to put it out! Thank goodness it wasn't the residences..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raimund",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raimund",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Keep fighting the fire. I'll get help."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anxious Inhabitant",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Water! *cough* More water!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Calm Inhabitant",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The fire's too fierce!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Calm Inhabitant",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Careful of the smoke! Close the door, that might keep the fire from spreading..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anxious Inhabitant",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What are you talking about?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anxious Inhabitant",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's the sacrarium! The holy statue is in there! Closing the door won't put the fire out!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Calm Inhabitant",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's not what I mean! But it's too dangerous right now!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A wise decision."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anxious Inhabitant",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What do <i>you</i> know... who are you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Estara & Erendel",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anxious Inhabitant",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Kids...? No, how could you bring children to a dangerous place like this?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anxious Inhabitant",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Stay away! It's not safe here!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're right. It's not safe."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You've inhaled a lot of smoke. Continue to do so, and you'll begin experiencing symptoms of smoke inhalation."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anxious Inhabitant",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So what? Got anything useful to say?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anxious Inhabitant",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I've never seen you before... you're Sankta, right? From Laterano? That's a holy statue of Laterano! Do something!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "My mission does not involve the statue."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anxious Inhabitant",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What are you talking about? Now's no time to talk about some 'mission'!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anxious Inhabitant",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Use your... your... your Arts to put that bloody fire out, or get out of the way if you're not gonna help!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm afraid I'm unable to use Arts suitable for that purpose."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "More people are needed to fight the fire and minimize damage."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anxious Inhabitant",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'll get help!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "There's no need."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "They're coming."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anxious Inhabitant",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're here..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cautious Sarkaz Inhabitant",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We got word from Raimund."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hot-Headed Sarkaz",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Enough talk. Take the bucket! I'll go get more!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anxious Inhabitant",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A-Alright!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raimund",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "More here!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I've got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Find a safe place to wait."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raimund",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're that Lateran..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raimund",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And what of the kids?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I do not believe now is the right time to discuss that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raimund",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hmph."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raimund",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Here, bucket."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Calm Inhabitant",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Clément!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Calm Inhabitant",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Stop, Clément! Don't go any further!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I advise against going into the scene of the fire right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Clément",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Let me go! Let me go!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It is dangerous without proper protective equipment."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Calm Inhabitant",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "He's right!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Calm Inhabitant",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Are you trying to get yourself killed?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Clément",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I have to—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Clément",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I have to..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Clément",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Clément",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sorry... I lost my head."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Calm Inhabitant",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I know it hurts, but this is serious."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Calm Inhabitant",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Flowers can be replanted."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Clément",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Clément",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We're running out of water. I'll fill a few more buckets."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raimund",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We can't go any further! The fire and smoke are too much..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You can stay behind."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I suggest not speaking loudly to avoid smoke inhalation."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raimund",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And who's the reason I have to speak?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You don't need to follow me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raimund",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I don't trust you. I'm keeping an eye on you."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raimund",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wait, did you hear that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The fire continues to burn, and the gun-wielding statue creaks ominously.\nIt casts a scorching shadow on Raimund, as though passing judgment on the Sarkaz who dared to set foot in a Sankta sacrarium, as it begins to topple in the fire."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raimund",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "—!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Get back!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "There is a sharp cracking sound, but the expected pain does not come.\nThe Executor stands before the Sarkaz, his gun held high."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This way, before anything else falls!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raimund",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Your arm..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raimund",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No, wait a second, you destroyed the statue?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I did not destroy it, only changed its direction to prevent it from hitting you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raimund",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But it's your statue..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That does not matter."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raimund",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The fire continues to grow. It's atypical."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Although furnishings like wooden benches are flammable, the initial location of the fire was unusual. It's possible that something else caused the fire."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raimund",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What do you mean? What are you trying to say?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hm?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That is..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Is this where the Sarkaz live?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(The walls are too thin to guard against the winds blowing across the wastes.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(It really is chilly.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(It's getting dark. I'm taking too long.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Hm?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Is that a fire I see up there?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(A fire, now?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerToken": null,
